        "original_id": "0a04df0e-9616-5256-b706-c867bf6b7277",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ozzy Osbourne, Curt Smith, Roland Orzabal\n- Bands: Black Sabbath, Tears for Fears\n- Songs: \"Change\", \"Mothers Talk\"\n- Roles: singer, songwriter, actor, bassist\n\nFacts:\n- Ozzy Osbourne was born on 3 December 1948 and is an English singer, songwriter, and actor.\n- Ozzy Osbourne was fired from Black Sabbath in 1979.\n- After leaving Black Sabbath, Ozzy Osbourne had a successful solo career, released 11 studio albums, and his first seven studio albums were all certified multi-platinum in the United States.\n- \"Mothers Talk\" is a 1984 song by the British band Tears for Fears.\n- \"Change\" was written by Roland Orzabal, sung by Tears for Fears bassist Curt Smith, and released as the band's fourth single.\n- Curt Smith has released four solo albums as a solo artist.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
